	<tr>
	<td valign="top" align="left" bgcolor="#000000">
	<blockquote>
	<font size="2" color="#FFFFFF" face="Verdana">
   Hello!<br>I met and played with three of your members tonight, Denna, Tiky and Jarenz.  They were just great and we had so much fun!  Several of your higher level members stopped by as well.  Denna, Tiky and Jarez requested that I submit an application to join, so I did!<P>My main character is a 50 Druid, Druwe Firewolf, currently a member of Pretentious Malevolent Sisters (better known as PMS).  As some of you might know PMS is disbanding at the end of February, and Druwe has made formal application to join with Sterling Order of Knights.  With PMS or SOK I am sure I have been on a raid or teamed with members of The Aredhel before and it was nice to find such a friendly bunch from your guild tonight.  Hope to meet more of you soon.
	<p>
	Systerr
	
	
	
	</blockquote>
